  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening local governance institutions and communities for lasting peace and enabling environment for Elections in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen local governance institutions and communities to support peaceful reintegration of the returnees and creating enabling environment for implementation of the extended road map for lasting peace deal including elections. Through a holistic approach, the project will concretely respond to the needs of refugees and returnees, strengthen the local government, and contribute to peaceful and inclusive elections through integrated solutions, including justice and peacebuil</narrative>
  </description>
